{"id":"5473eae254230968","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-basic-elimination.md","title":"基本切消界 2^α","display":"thm-basic-elimination — 基本切消界 2^α","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-basic-elimination","aliases":["18-thm-basic-elimination"],"display":"thm-basic-elimination — 基本切消界 2^α","depends_on":["[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Lemmas 7.3.12–7.3.13","source_pages":"114–116","source_pdf_pages":"124–126","verification_status":"source-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-basic-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-basic-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-basic-elimination — 基本切消界 2^α"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemmas 7.3.12–7.3.13"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"114–116"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"124–126"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 严格取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8accc2f8cbc49eab\" href=\"?note=8accc2f8cbc49eab\" title=\"18-df-semiformal-derivability\">18-df-semiformal-derivability</a> 的原书系统，序数指数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" href=\"?note=5c52eb8a9d5ba532\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation\">18-df-ordinal-exponentiation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_{\\rho+1}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\rho^{2^\\alpha}(\\Delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_{\\rho+1}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\rho^{2^\\alpha}(\\Delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Lemma 7.3.13 的陈述与证明已核对。对 α 归纳，非临界步骤按严格递增的 2^ξ 提升高度；临界切在归纳后以 Lemma 7.3.12 的 α+β 归约界得到 2<sup>{α₀}+2</sup>{α₀}=2<sup>{α₀+1}≤2</sup>α。原书秩只取有限数；不能将此结果无条件推广到任意带序数秩的外加语言与规则。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-semiformal-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-semiformal-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"8accc2f8cbc49eab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 严格取 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的原书系统，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-exponentiation","status":"resolved","id":"5c52eb8a9d5ba532","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}$；$D$ 严格取 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的原书系统，序数指数取 [[18-df-ordinal-exponentiation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta\\in[\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\rho+1}^\\alpha(\\Delta)\\ \\longrightarrow\\ D_\\rho^{2^\\alpha}(\\Delta).","display":true}],"bytes":1220,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-basic-elimination]]"},{"id":"4104af313be51221","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fca2fdd37fa20a53","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由 [[18-thm-basic-elimination]] 的原书 2^α 界和 Structural Lemma 7.3.7 得到：2^α≤ω^α，可提高高度上界。文件名是保留的本地ID；原书 Definition 5.3.1 是真算术句分类观察，并非切消定理。修复旧稿“任意无穷演算 P”适用范围过宽的问题。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-basic-elimination]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-basic-elimination|18-thm-basic-elimination]]"}],"outgoing":["8accc2f8cbc49eab","5c52eb8a9d5ba532"]}